":[["Slots",8],["Load factor","0/8 = 0.00"]]},{"caption":"hash(“cat”) = 99 + 97 + 116 = 312, and 312 mod 8 = <b>0</b>.","cells":[["cat","","","","","","",""],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"b"},"stats":[["Slots",8],["Load factor","1/8 = 0.12"]]},{"caption":"hash(“dog”) = 100 + 111 + 103 = 314, and 314 mod 8 = <b>2</b>.","cells":[["cat","","dog","","","","",""],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"a","0,2":"b"},"stats":[["Slots",8],["Load factor","2/8 = 0.25"]]},{"caption":"hash(“emu”) = 101 + 109 + 117 = 327, and 327 mod 8 = <b>7</b>.","cells":[["cat","","dog","","","","","emu"],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"a","0,2":"a","0,7":"b"},"stats":[["Slots",8],["Load factor","3/8 = 0.38"]]},{"caption":"hash(“fox”) = 102 + 111 + 120 = 333, and 333 mod 8 = <b>5</b>.","cells":[["cat","","dog","","","fox","","emu"],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"a","0,2":"a","0,5":"b","0,7":"a"},"stats":[["Slots",8],["Load factor","4/8 = 0.50"]]},{"caption":"hash(“gnu”) = 103 + 110 + 117 = 330, and 330 mod 8 = <b>2</b>. Slot 2 taken, so probe forward to the next free one: <b>3</b>.","cells":[["cat","","dog","gnu","","fox","","emu"],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"a","0,2":"bad","0,3":"b","0,5":"a","0,7":"a"},"stats":[["Slots",8],["Load factor","5/8 = 0.62"]]},{"caption":"Inserting “yak” would make the table 6/8 full, over 2/3. <b>Resize</b>: allocate 16 slots and re-insert everything, because each key's slot depends on the table size.","cells":[["cat","","dog","gnu","","fox","","emu"],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"cellCls":{"0,0":"a","0,2":"a","0,3":"a","0,5":"a","0,7":"a"},"stats":[["Slots",8],["Load factor","5/8 = 0.62"]]},{"caption":"After rehashing into 16 slots, keys move: cat 0 → 8, dog 2 → 10, gnu 3 → 11, fox 5 → 13. That re-insertion is O(n) work, but doubling makes it rare, so inserts stay O(1) amortized.","cells":[["","","","","",